        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in introducing this fantastic 4-bedroom semi-detached family home to the market ideally located within the quaint cul de sac of Ellensborough Park, Kiltipper. \r\n\r\nEllensborough ever in demand, is enviably positioned within arm's reach of all essential amenities including esteemed primary & secondary schools, extensive leisure & sports facilities, convenience stores & The Square Shopping Centre, along with Ellensborough Lawn positioned right beside a Greenway with access to Bohernabreena reservoir walkway. On a transport note, bus routes are plentiful and the M50 Motorway is found within minutes by car. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 115 sqm in brief compromises of entrance hallway with guest bathroom, living room with fireplace and bay window, fully fitted kitchen, utility room and separate dining room to the rear. On the first floor you will find four generous bedrooms with built in wardrobes (one master ensuite) and the main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. \r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed private garden which comes of the lowest maintenance. The front provides ample off-street parking on a beautiful cul de sac with virtually no passing traffic and further benefitted by overlooking a large green area. \r\n\r\nNo. 10 comes to the market as a blank canvas in good condition throughout with no onward chain. It has plenty of additional features such as extra spacious living, fully fitted kitchen, gas fired central heating with combi-boiler and fully tiled main family bathroom to name but a few. \r\nThis wonderful home offers a great opportunity for a wide range of buyers looking to settle roots in one of Dublin 24s most sought-after areas.\r\nPlease contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to arrange a viewing here as this one shouldn't be missed! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 115 sqm \r\n- BER C \r\n- 4 bed / 3 bath \r\n- Semi-detached family home \r\n- Good condition throughout \r\n- Generous living space \r\n- Entrance hall with guest bathroom\r\n- Large living room with fireplace \r\n- Bay window in living room \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Separate dining room to rear \r\n- Separate utility/washroom\r\n- Four generous bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Master bedroom ensuite \r\n- Main family bathroom fully tiled\r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- New gas combi-boiler \r\n- Ample storage space \r\n- Low maintenance rear garden \r\n- Private & fully enclosed \r\n- Ample parking to the front \r\n- Peaceful cul de sac setting\r\n- Overlooking large green area \r\n- Right at the foot of the Dublin Mountains \r\n- Exclusive and highly sought-after development \r\n- The ideal family home \r\n\r\nDirections - D24 NWF7"
      },
